; rowsum_ungridded: ROWSUM without a grid must raise.
;
; No RESIZE ran, so rows = cols = 0 and there is no row to sum. An empty
; reduction would push 0, so this vector pins InvalidGridDimensions -- the
; same identity ONEHOTR and ONEHOTC raise without a grid.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0

PUSH 0           ; row
ROWSUM r0
HALT
